FOAI modifications
------------------

FOAI (A.I.M.S. / ACHIEVEMOR) has added a source-level governance layer on top of
the upstream code. The additions are governed by the same MIT License. The exact
delta — every file added or changed and the reason for it — is documented in:

    ./FORK-CHANGES.md

In summary, the FOAI delta adds:

  - INV-3 (Stage Zero): every model call is verified to originate from the
    A.I.M.S. Gateway, and carries a per-call Stage Zero decision ID.
  - CSP (Context Security Protocol): the blind whole-file overwrite path is
    structurally removed; edits go through exact-match replacement.
  - Receipts: enforcement events are emitted for Charlotte's audit ledger.
  - Fail-closed startup: the runtime refuses to launch ungoverned unless an
    explicit, non-default acknowledgement is provided.

